From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: michael moore <mrmoore27@pm.me>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:12:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] rnd/sov-002: gateway signs XBT-NTA per tip; Prime builds
 attested coinbasers

lazarus-gateway (nta_key_file) signs NtaAttestationHash(OP_1 <K>, height, nBits,
prev) with its payout key for every template and sends it to Prime as mining
sub-command 0x4e ahead of the coinbaser request. primed (nta-height,
nta-pool-key-file) checks each attestation against its own node's tip, and from
activation pays only attested scripts plus the pool (self-signed), appending one
70-byte attestation per distinct payee in Knots' order. Unattested payees are
deferred as UnpaidReason::Unattested and carried. /nta.json reports per-tip
signers and signature latency. Digest and signatures match the Knots helpers and
SOV-001's node-judged vectors byte for byte.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
